{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48922","headline":"乙巳岁愚春秋四十九辞疾拜章将免左掖重阳独登上方 · 司空图","name":"乙巳岁愚春秋四十九辞疾拜章将免左掖重阳独登上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪鬓不禁镊，知非又此年。\n退居还有旨，荣路免妨贤。\n落落鸣蛩鸟，晴霞度雁天。\n自无佳节兴，依旧菊篱边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}